{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_title", "source_sha256": "3c77d8aff9986d030f02dee4fc0672ed99196e7899d8c46b2992053176e223c7", "ja": "ライブMC　～楽しい時間は～", "zh": "演唱会MC　～快乐的时光～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ec280103622246b669e37b0b347f00f520f86490a715129c9d4fdddb894155d8", "ja": "ライブも終盤、テンションは最高潮！　しか\nし次が最後の曲……あずさがそう伝えると、\n客席からは驚きと悲しみの声が。出番は伸ば\nせないけど、最後まで一生懸命歌うと言う星\n梨花に、観客は歓声で応えるのだった。", "zh": "演唱会也接近尾声，气氛达到最高潮！可\n是下一首就是最后一首歌……当三浦梓这样告知时，\n观众席传来了惊讶与悲伤的声音。虽然无法延长\n演出时间，但箱崎星梨花表示会努力唱到最后，观\n众便用欢呼声回应了她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "a5dbc854ff4636483a294dec92734b545240bb342cf153c2a76eaa22671150ee", "ja": "ごヒイキ様方、いかがでしたか？　私たちの\n記念公演、楽しんでいただけてますでしょうか？", "zh": "各位贵宾，感觉如何？我们的纪念公演，大家还享受得尽兴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1001_null", "source_sha256": "2001a3bfcb555e46cf8dde697137eadcde92c0278346e59fb9b648a934b0752d", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア………！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊………！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "331d48acce8c7a7c8d2468036609158a7b0f26828575948df190622d63f6d75b", "ja": "まぁ、すごい声援……！　みなさん、\n素敵なお返事をありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哎呀，好热烈的欢呼声……！\n非常感谢大家的精彩回应♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "2b6079f4df17e200958634a21ebefbfe5375ef6d97d51b1ec1ca2cb5aff75f6e", "ja": "わたしたち、こんなに大勢のみなさんに応援して\nもらってるんですね。がんばらなくちゃです！", "zh": "原来有这么多人在为我们加油啊。我们也得努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "fd0fc6fb0c85d653f077908bbf488cb101a9f765be493caf6e3ccf1951ec9758", "ja": "うんうん、そうだよね～。なんかアタシたちのほうが、\nみんなに元気をもらってるみたいだよね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，就是说呀～。总觉得反倒是我们\n从大家那里获得了活力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "f799e6e1401664099b5a5d568870205327c2b7f458c3e86cb8517bd8b0bc65cc", "ja": "はい、みなさんすごいです！　恵美さん、あずささん、\nエミリーちゃん。わたしたちも負けていられませんね！", "zh": "是的，大家都好厉害！　惠美、梓、\n艾米莉。我们也不能输给大家呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "f35a0ed018727473f41f8bbedc76ef8c0d204d97a81a1baa867e5633be4722e1", "ja": "うふふ、そうね。元気にしてもらった分、\n私たちも、たくさんお返ししなくちゃね？", "zh": "呵呵，是呀。得到了大家给的活力，\n我们也得好好回报才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "c873f20c6bfbf20f01cfa8ea2fc412a4e1ac82a7b699ab196bb946ce68c50acf", "ja": "おっ、いいコト言うね～あずさ！　そうそう、\nアタシたちも今日の公演、すっごく楽しみにしてたし！", "zh": "哦，说得好啊～阿梓莎！对对，我们也一直特别期待今天的公演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "f7cd92876274f553d1d026661f78bebfafa6cec5ba375faf4782a5c825f5b51f", "ja": "そうですね。私も、今日という日が来るのを\n一日千秋の思いで待ち続けてました！", "zh": "是啊。我也一直望眼欲穿地等待着今天的到来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "5ae099727f1803851d9ece6e96c1d61fdf5ae9940ecee4347b8ba70d93ea3e01", "ja": "けど、始まってみるとあっと言う間だったわ……。\n私たち、次の曲で最後ですものね。", "zh": "不过，真正开始后转眼就结束了……毕竟下一首歌就是我们的最后一首了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1010_null", "source_sha256": "e3c258087dafc304f42463c44f249c88823ca8152b684c7634e1582c6c29cdf7", "ja": "えええええええっ！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "6da85b238c8b05acf0ad9b2ef57856acdde81f82ad396db506311bf974739335", "ja": "にゃはは、みんなありがとー！　アタシたちも、\nもっと歌いたいトコなんだけど……。", "zh": "呀哈哈，谢谢大家——！我们也还想继续唱下去，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "d84707830135fc05cdc68fdd4468c8e78f210a263f1ff9820e552174c3f134b3", "ja": "次のみなさんの出番もあるので……\nそれに、これが最後ではありませんから！", "zh": "接下来还有其他人的演出……\n而且，这还不是最后一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "0cc1a08ec45e07874a1e56795921bd2a8b01a39f430b6d9484cdc321202741b2", "ja": "その分、全力で歌います！　みなさん、\nわたしたちの歌、最後まで聞いてくれますか？", "zh": "作为补偿，我会全力歌唱！大家，愿意听完我们的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1014_null", "source_sha256": "0a07adea3eb908222854edd0e778ebf08d6cb58143ebef441e83f3dc149c855c", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "5b6b3a03e0ab135cbd10546e7121d0d4fe90be49ef7da2bba802f4e701b8248d", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪\nみんなでもっともっと、盛り上がっちゃいましょう。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢大家♪\n让我们一起把气氛炒得更热烈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "9310ad80f4e35817b4e57baf16aa6477c95d8ee150dbddbe713a8cef7ac3829c", "ja": "あ、でもみんな、\n休憩とか水分補給も忘れちゃダメだからね！", "zh": "啊，不过大家也别忘了休息和补充水分哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "c6cc02f78262cb9c293a796f4f3bee0139068d30f5a7e7a386da612552c95077", "ja": "無理せず、万全の状態で\n最後まで楽しんでいってくださいね～。", "zh": "请不要勉强自己，以最佳状态享受到最后哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_11_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "a0ab3a0b61253290cdb1e197cac7211af2aa10ad4abc14ee440c2409ce7e10a6", "ja": "それでは、次の曲に参りましょう！\nみなさま、どうか最後までお楽しみください！", "zh": "那么，接下来让我们进入下一首歌吧！\n各位，请尽情享受到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
